# ReXGlue SDK changes for WWE 2K14 (session66-native2): 61ca96d9f003..12af82b49813 on wwe2k14-local
# Apply in order on upstream rexglue/rexglue-sdk f5337cd (git apply). Commits (first parent):
#  12af82b wwe2k14 Session 66: keycost - cache the per-draw specialisation keys
#  c3e37db wwe2k14 Session 66: native_ext - gpu_native_fma (bit mask: 1 NATIVE pixel shaders, 2 NATIVE kVertex vertex shaders; looks right, off by default)
#  8ff39d0 wwe2k14 Session 66: native_ext - colour epilogue specialisation for NATIVE pixel shaders (gpu_native_ps_epilogue_spec, off by default)
#  4d1e521 wwe2k14 Session 66: native_ext - a second, NATIVE-only 32-bit specialisation word outside the (full) 64-bit modification
#  116073d wwe2k14 Session 66: VS mul - NATIVE vertex shader multiply rule modes (gpu_native_vs_mul_mode 0-3, gpu_native_vs_mul_fetch_finite, off by default)
#  7284c76 wwe2k14 Session 66: G1 dead resolves - gpu_native_truth_drop_dead_resolves (level 1: within a deferred batch)
#  d549c97 Merge branch 's66-specfix' into s66-native2
#  01170fd wwe2k14 Session 66: H1.1 fix - reopen the submission after the slot_reuse flush
#  686f241 wwe2k14 Session 66: PS spec 3 - NATIVE pixel shader implicit LOD (gpu_native_ps_implicit_lod, off by default)
#  df507d4 wwe2k14 Session 66: PS spec 2 - NATIVE pixel shader multiply rule modes (gpu_native_ps_mul_mode 0-3, off by default)
#  d779587 wwe2k14 Session 66: PS spec 1 - NATIVE pixel shader texture sign specialisation (gpu_native_ps_texture_spec, off by default)
#  c16dc0a wwe2k14 Session 66: H1.1 readback batching (readback_resolve_batch, off by default)
#  e0e43d6 Merge branch 's66-b2vertex' into s66-native2
#  4422d44 Merge branch 's66-g1census' into s66-native2
#  c9c1491 wwe2k14 Session 66: G2.1 gpu_native_truth_pass_dont_care - truth passes opening with a whole-surface fast clear do not load colour / depth+stencil (flag, default off)
#  00d08a5 wwe2k14 Session 66: dump_shaders covers NATIVE's own pixel shaders (vk_native; diagnostic only)

